<title>USA: Nuevo says R. Gerry resigns as vice chairman.</title>
<headline>Nuevo says R. Gerry resigns as vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nuevo Energy Co said Friday Robert Gerry  III resigned as vice-chairman and has accepted a position with VAALCO  Energy Inc as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The company said Gerry will remain a director. Before becoming vice-chairman  in 1994, he was president and chief operating officer since the company  was formed in 1990.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to provide information on  who will replace Gerry.</p>
</text>
